B.LG=new A.bF(36,"pass\xe9 compos\xe9 of Pronominal Verbs","A2","Pronominal verbs use \xeatre in the pass\xe9 compos\xe9.","subject + reflexive pronoun + `\xeatre` + past participle",B.TE,"Negative: Je ne me suis pas lev\xe9.","Pronominal pass\xe9 compos\xe9 keeps the reflexive pronoun and uses `\xeatre`: `je me suis lev\xe9`.","The reflexive pronoun stays before `\xeatre`. After that, build the tense like other `\xeatre` verbs: conjugated `\xeatre` + past participle, with agreement for the subject in the usual A2 cases.",B.a_y,B.WZ,"Keep the small pronoun: `je me suis lev\xe9`, not `je suis lev\xe9` when the verb is `se lever`.")
