B.Lj=new A.bF(45,"Comparatives","A2","Compare two people, things, or actions.","`plus\u2026 que`; `moins\u2026 que`; `aussi\u2026 que`",B.OD,"Irregular: bon \u2192 meilleur.","Comparatives say more than, less than, or as much/as...as.","Use the comparison word around the adjective/adverb, then add `que` before the second thing. With nouns and verbs, the pattern changes slightly, but `que` still introduces the comparison.",B.TL,B.a1t,"Use `que`, not `comme`, for most A2 comparisons: `plus grand que`, not `plus grand comme`.")
