B.KX=new A.bF(48,"Imperfect (imparfait)","A2","Use for habits, descriptions, background, ongoing past situations.","present nous stem + `-ais`, `-ais`, `-ait`, `-ions`, `-iez`, `-aient`",B.Xl,"\xeatre is irregular: j'\xe9tais, tu \xe9tais, il \xe9tait\u2026","The imperfect is made from the present `nous` stem + imperfect endings.","Use it for what was ongoing, repeated, descriptive, or background in the past. To conjugate it, start from the present `nous` form, remove `-ons`, and add the endings.",B.Yb,B.RL,"Do not use the infinitive as the stem: `je parlais`, not `je parlerais` for the imperfect.")
